# Resolve the @Animeshmitra08 scope from GitHub Packages.
# Scope must be lowercase — npm scope matching is case-sensitive and npm
# rejects package names containing capital letters.
#
# The token is read from the GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN environment variable.
# Never paste a raw token into this file — it is committed.
@Animeshmitra08:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN}